WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.448
ONE OF THESE 100 PEOPLE IS A MILLIONAIRE!

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.584
AND NOBODY KNOWS WHO!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.524
You have 60 seconds and three clues. Find the millionaire!

00:00:09.724 --> 00:00:12.412
Easy! Look at that guy's watch!

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:15.468
Bro, being rich doesn't mean wearing expensive stuff!

00:00:15.668 --> 00:00:18.548
CLUE NUMBER ONE! He started with just one hundred dollars!

00:00:18.748 --> 00:00:20.356
That's literally everyone!

00:00:20.556 --> 00:00:23.268
Wait... what if he built something from nothing?

00:00:23.468 --> 00:00:25.556
Then we need to find someone with a story.

00:00:25.756 --> 00:00:27.748
I FOUND HIM! LOOK AT THIS GUY!

00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:29.916
Dude, I'm a delivery driver!

00:00:30.116 --> 00:00:32.036
Stop judging people by their clothes!

00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:35.500
FINAL CLUE! He gave away his first million dollars to help other people!

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.316
Wait... I think I know who it is.

00:00:38.516 --> 00:00:39.308
WHO?!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.944
Sir... are you the millionaire?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.632
Yes. That's me.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.392
WAIT... YOU?!

00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:51.928
I started with a hundred dollars. I wanted to build something that could help people.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Money means nothing if you never use it to help someone.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.400
Would YOU have guessed him?

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.256
Honestly? NO!

